.* QUIAUTLOBJ: DSPAUTLOBJ, the objects an authorization list secures.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=AUTL CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=AUTLLIB CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='QSYS'.
:VAR NAME=OWNER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=PGP CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='*NONE'.
:VAR NAME=OBJ CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTYPE CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJOWNER CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=OBJTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=OBJS VARS='OBJ OBJLIB OBJTYPE OBJOWNER OBJTEXT'.
:KEYL NAME=KEYS HELP=KEYSHLP.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPAUTLOBJ KEYL=KEYS HELP=AUTLOBJH ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SPACE.Display Authorization List Objects
:DATA DEPTH=4.
:DATACOL WIDTH=78.
:DATAC.Authorization list . . . . . . . . :   &AUTL.
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=NONE.
:DATAC.Library  . . . . . . . . . . . . :     &AUTLLIB.
:EDATAGRP.
:DATAC.Owner  . . . . . . . . . . . . . . :   &OWNER.
:DATAC.Primary group  . . . . . . . . . . :   &PGP.
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=OBJS SCROLL=YES.(The authorization list secures no objects.)
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJ' VAR=OBJ USAGE=OUTPUT.Object
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJLIB' VAR=OBJLIB USAGE=OUTPUT.Library
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJTYPE' VAR=OBJTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Type
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJOWNER' VAR=OBJOWNER USAGE=OUTPUT.Owner
:LISTCOL HELP='FLD/OBJTEXT' VAR=OBJTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Text
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=AUTLOBJH.Display Authorization List Objects - Help
:P.Every object secured by the authorization list: whoever is on the
list has the list's authority to each of them.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=KEYSHLP.Function keys - Help
:P.F3 and F12 leave.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJ'.Object
:P.The object of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJLIB'.Library
:P.The library of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJTYPE'.Type
:P.The type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJOWNER'.Owner
:P.The owner of the objects created.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/OBJTEXT'.Text
:P.The text of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
